ve different validity rules when they don't. Drop it (or, if kept for safety, make the intent explicit in a comment) so the structured and flat paths tell a consistent story.\n\nNone of these are blocking correctness issues \u2014 they're about keeping the new code aligned with the helper-owns-the-rule structure the rest of the `owner` package follows."
